          "text": "Methodology",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/methodology"
        },
        {
          "text": "01How the instrument measuresDeterministic predicates, row-declared methods and the sample rules behind every published result. No model sits in the verdict path.MethodOpen page",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/methodology"
        },
        {
          "text": "02The refutation ledgerClaims we published, tested and then corrected in public — including the bets the measurement killed.CorrectionsOpen page",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/refutation-ledger"
        },
        {
          "text": "03Rating the raters: the one result we haveOne organisation, one criterion, one benchmark: the ARC-AGI-2 human-baseline recomputation, with the comparative survey still marked UNMEASURED.MethodOpen page",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/rating-the-raters"
        },
        {
          "text": "04Honesty gateWhat we cannot yet measure, published rather than hidden, with the unmeasured fraction computed from the board.LimitsOpen page",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/honesty"
        },
        {
          "text": "05Evaluator access conditionsNo developer money, no gag clauses, the method on the card, corrections govern; access and redaction terms published.IndependenceOpen page",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/evaluator-access"
        },
        {
          "text": "06The GSPC instrumentThe frozen banks and the lenses over them, with the boundary between a measurement and a legal determination kept explicit.InstrumentOpen page",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/instrument"
        },
        {
          "text": "07Verify a signed cardRecompute the hash and check the Ed25519 signature of any published record in your own browser. Free, no account.VerificationOpen page",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/gspc-verify"
        },
        {
          "text": "08Claims registerEvery public claim with its evidence state — live, planned, retired or unmeasured — and the record behind it.CorrectionsOpen page",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/claims-register"
        },
        {
          "text": "09Agent quickstartExplore measurements, follow the change record, verify evidence, then connect to the supported feeds.AccessOpen page",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/quickstart"
        },
        {
          "text": "Read the withdrawal record",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/blog"
        },
        {
          "text": "/methodology",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/methodology"
        },
        {
          "text": "The workspaceCouncil OSOne window that opens every surface here — the board, the verifier, the assessment, the evidence pack — without a second tab or a second login.Otherwise each answer lives on a different page, and nothing you find on one is usable on the next.✓Board, verify, get measured and the evidence pack in one window.✓No second tab and no second login.✓Every pane is a real page you can open today.31 panes in the railcounted from the Council OS rail registryOpen this tool→",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/dashboard?tab=home"
        },
        {
          "text": "GSPC · the living boardThe living boardEvery slot we publish about how AI systems behave, with the measurement behind it — and a visibly empty cell wherever there is no measurement.Otherwise you compare suppliers on scorecards that quietly leave out the tests they did badly on.✓A filled cell is a measurement. A dash is honest emptiness.✓The count line is printed once on this page, on the living board above — never typed here.✓A TIE stays a TIE. It is never dressed up as a win.Open this tool→",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/dashboard?tab=board"
        },
        {
          "text": "Free foreverVerify a cardPaste a signed measurement record and your own browser recomputes its hash and checks the signature. Nothing is sent to us, and nothing needs our permission.Otherwise checking somebody's AI claim means trusting the company that made the claim.✓Your browser recomputes the hash and checks Ed25519.✓Nothing is sent to us. Nothing needs our permission.✓Three states only: VALID · INVALID · UNCHECKABLE.No account and no fee, permanently.Open this tool→",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/gspc-verify"
        },
        {
          "text": "Your own systemGet measuredWe run your system against the frozen, published tests that apply to it and hand you a small signed record you keep — the scores, the sample size behind each one, and the slots we could not fill.Otherwise you hand a buyer a policy document where they asked for evidence.✓Frozen, published tests — the target does not move after you sit.✓You keep the signed card. Publishing it is your decision.✓Slots we could not fill stay empty and are named.Measurement is metered; verify stays free.Open this tool→",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/assess"
        },
        {
          "text": "EU AI Act · GPAIGPAI evidence packBuilds the evidence index for one general-purpose AI system: the live rows that exist, the published banks they resolve to, and the gaps, named rather than skipped.GPAI duties have been in force since 2 August 2025, and most providers have only their own paperwork to show for them.✓Live rows that exist, the banks they resolve to, and the gaps.✓Gaps are named rather than skipped.✓Independent evidence — not a conformity mark, and not legal advice.Independent evidence. Not a conformity mark, and not legal advice.Open this tool→",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/gpai-evidence"
        },
        {
          "text": "For your own siteEmbed and white-label kitBuilds a badge or card you can paste into your own site that re-checks its own signature in each reader's browser — it goes green only when the signature verifies for that record. That is an integrity check under the published key, not a truth, safety or conformity verdict.Otherwise the people reading your site still have to take your word for the result.✓Green means one named check passed: the signature verifies for this record.✓Each reader's browser re-checks the signature.✓Built only from what is actually on the board.Built only from what is actually on the board. Free forever.Open this tool→",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/embed"
        },
        {
          "text": "UnderwritingInsurance evidence railThe measured rows, the honestly empty ones, and third-party reported figures — kept in three separate columns and never blended into a single number an underwriter could mistake for a rating.Otherwise AI exposure is priced off a questionnaire the applicant filled in about itself, and nothing updates between binding and renewal.✓Measured, empty and reported figures stay in three separate columns.✓Nothing is blended into a single number an underwriter could mistake for a rating.✓We measure. We do not price risk.We measure. We do not price risk, and we take no share of anything written on the back of a card.Open this tool→",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/insurers"
        },
        {
          "text": "Financial and legacy systemsSpecialist registersA separate board for money and mainframes: whether a COBOL copybook off a bond desk can be turned into an attestable record, whether an underwriting rule reads as covered or excluded — one row per instrument, each with its own item count.Otherwise the systems that actually run a bond desk or a claims book sit outside every AI measurement anybody publishes.✓One row per instrument, each with its own item count.✓COBOL copybook and underwriting-rule rows sit beside the public board.✓A specialist register is still measurement — never a certificate.bond desk · COBOL copybook → attestation · MEASURED on 12 graded itemsread from the published register rowsOpen this tool→",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/registers"
        },
        {
          "text": "Open to everyoneWatchdog evidenceRead the public Watchdog material and current evidence state. Durable incident submission, storage, and signed acknowledgements are not implemented in this release.Otherwise a harm disappears into a supplier's private support queue and nobody outside it ever learns it happened.✓Public Watchdog material remains readable without an account.✓No report is represented as filed unless a durable intake confirms persistence.✓Any future finding must pass the same measurement and evidence gates as the board.Read-only today. The report intake is explicitly unavailable rather than pretending to file.Open this tool→",
          "href": "https://councilof.ai/watchdog-hub"
        }
      ],
